<title>USA: TABLE -- Philadelphia Fed index 21.1 in March.</title>
<headline>TABLE -- Philadelphia Fed index 21.1 in March.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia on Thursday said its index of business activity in the manufacturing sector rose to 21.1 in March from 17.4 in February</p>
<p>			    March   Drop   Unch   Rise     Feb</p>
<p>Business Conditions    21.1   14.0   47.4   35.1    17.4</p>
<p>New orders		 18.8   19.9   39.8   38.7    20.7</p>
<p>Shipments		  23.9   14.5   43.3   38.5    10.0</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 7.7   20.7   64.8   13.1   - 6.2</p>
<p>Delivery time	   - 3.1   12.2   78.8    9.0   - 8.4</p>
<p>Inventories	     -11.1   33.2   44.7   22.1   - 8.4</p>
<p>Prices paid		13.3    7.1   72.6   20.3     6.3</p>
<p>Prices received	 - 2.4   16.7   68.7   14.4     0.8</p>
<p>Number of employees    10.5   13.7   60.1   24.2     0.1</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660 ))</p>
